      "writtenOn": "2022-11-24T14:18:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To call call this interface function to stop a cpu and return quickly,wait\nfor the end of the work in a separated function cpu_stop_work_wait() for the CPU isolation. we try to use stop_on_cpu() function, it takes too long times, so occurs scheduling timeout on the current cpu which will trigger panic.",
      "parentUuid": "1cb8689f_3ffd6ee5",
      "revId": "a0986a09767b7e3b8d1007dcfa0595ff396159ee",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2e82bdb6_9fbff90c",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
