        "id": 1569742
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-24T14:23:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this patch doesn\u0027t introduce in-tree users of the function, and it can\u0027t be used out-of-tree either due to the absence of EXPORT_SYMBOL(), it is not clear how this is going be helpful to anyone. As Vincent hinted in a comment earlier, the CPU isolation feature has been deprecated and is not supported in recent kernels, so I would recommend that you look at alternatives, thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "668c9087_d1287b23",
      "revId": "a0986a09767b7e3b8d1007dcfa0595ff396159ee",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
